				</div>

				<h1
					class="mb-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 md:text-6xl dark:text-white"
				>
					I ship multi-channel campaigns
					<span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500"
						>on time, on budget, on brand.</span
					>
				</h1>

				<p
					class="mb-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 md:text-xl dark:text-slate-400"
				>
					I'm <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Tony Rosen</strong>,
					a Marketing &amp; Creative Project Manager with 10+ years leading
					cross-functional teams, agencies, and freelancers — including campaign
					work for Pfizer, Science Magazine, and global product launches in
					regulated industries.
				</p>

				<!-- CTAs -->
				<div class="mb-14 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
					<a
						href="/#resume"
						class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition-colors hover:bg-blue-700"
					>
						View Resume
						<svg
							class="h-4 w-4"
							fill="none"
							stroke="currentColor"
							stroke-width="2.5"
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							aria-hidden="true"
							><path
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
								d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg
						>
					</a>
					<a
						href="mailto:anthonyrosen@gmail.com"
						class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-blue-600 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 dark:hover:border-blue-500 dark:hover:text-blue-400"
					>
						Email Me
					</a>
					<a
						href="https://linkedin.com/in/anthonyrosen"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener"
						class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-blue-600 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-blue-400"
